  :adr/title "ADR-2607141700: cloud-itonami の会社経営を PR/merge 駆動の CD/CI workflow にする — kotoba-git/kotoba-rad + kotobase + DataLad backend、部署/社員の CACAO capability で ref 権限を制御"
  :adr/topic "cloud-itonami-git-native-business-cdci"
  :adr/status "proposed"
  :adr/date "2026-07-14"
  :adr/last_verified "2026-07-14"
  :adr/deciders ["Jun Kawasaki"]
  :adr/authoritative true
  :adr/authoritative_for
  ["business operation(受信→提案→承認→実行→監査)の git-native 表現: メール受信 = proposal ref 到着(PR)、承認 = did:key 署名付き ff-only merge、実行 = post-merge itonami-runner、監査 = audit ref への append-only commit"
   "backend は GitHub でなく kotoba-git/kotoba-rad(sovereign refs + push-gate) + kotobase private tenant + kotoba-ledger-clj file-git backend + DataLad/git-annex/B2(大容量)。GitHub は code repo の public mirror のみ"
   "権限モデル: 社員 = did:key、org root → 部署 delegate → 社員の CACAO delegation chain、resource = itonami://<org>/<repo>/<lane>、ability = propose/review/merge/execute/read、risk tier ごとの merge 署名要件、proposer/approver/executor の鍵分離"
   "CQRS: 署名付き git DAG = write-model、既存 Datom store = read-model(Datalog query 面)。store は廃止しない"]
